  ── Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────

    ↑↓ jk          move
    1–9            open that row
    esc            back to hosts
    n              new session
    enter          attach
    space          peek at the screen
    r f2           rename
    d              delete
    y              copy the attach command
    a              add host
    i              host details
    /              search every host
    alt+e          show ended
    ?              keys
    q              quit
    ctrl+o         commands
    ctrl+c ctrl+c  quit

